<% look = @look_ahead %>
Your week, <%= @person.first_name %>
<% if look.clashes.any? %>

Due on a day you're out: <%= look.clashes.map { |task| "#{task.title} (#{l(task.due_on, format: "%a")})" }.to_sentence %>.
<% end %>

Due this week:
<% if look.tasks.any? %>
<% look.tasks.each do |task| %>
- <%= l(task.due_on, format: "%a %b %-d") %>: <%= task.title %><%= " (#{task.work.title})" if task.work %>
<% end %>
<% else %>
Nothing of yours is due this week.
<% end %>
<% if look.overdue.positive? %>

<%= look.overdue %> overdue from before.
<% end %>
<% if look.out.any? || look.holidays.any? %>

Away:
<% look.holidays.each do |holiday| %>
- <%= l(holiday.date, format: "%a %b %-d") %>: <%= holiday.name %> (everyone)
<% end %>
<% look.out.each do |off| %>
- <%= off.user.display_name %>: <%= off.span_text %><%= " (half day)" if off.half_day? %>
<% end %>
<% end %>

Open the calendar: <%= calendar_page_url(view: "week", host: Runwell.host, protocol: Runwell.protocol) %>
